data: {"conversationId":"conv-002","fullText":"I'm holding it back — that landed in a conversation I can't rule a picture out of, so it didn't write down to the store. The pack flagged 10 items withheld for exactly that reason.\n\nWhat I can do: ask you straight up, or search if you point me at where it lives (email, the OS, a file). Which would help?"}

